            For most yards, the EGO ME0800 is the edger to buy if you are on EGO batteries, and the Greenworks ED40L410 kit is the cordless pick if you are starting from nothing. If your edges are short and near an outlet, the Black+Decker LE750 or Worx WG896 will do the same job for much less.
          </p>
